  "description": "First floor rear extension to provide 1 x 1 bed studio flat and alterations to existing flat; bin and cycle stores",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reason of the inaccurate drawings submitted, would not provide family sized homes with three or more bedrooms. The proposed development would therefore fail to achieve an appropriate housing mix, having regard to the location of the site and its surroundings as well as the evidence of local need which identifies a need for larger family sized units and would fail to contribute to the creation of inclusive and mixed communities, contrary to the provisions of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies H1, H2 and H10 of the London Plan (2021) and policies HO1 and HO2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
